.Dd October 3, 2026
.Dt ECHO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm echo
.Nd print a line of text
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl n
.Ar string ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes each
.Ar string
to stdout, separated by spaces and terminated by a newline.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width -Ds
.It Fl n
do not print the terminating newline.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr printf 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
